@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Fase de Losetas (Phase.TILES): Rotación en Tiempo Real y Colocación en el Tablero

actor "Jugador Actual" as Player
participant "Game.tsx" as View
participant "MatchTileController" as Controller
participant "MatchTileService" as ServiceLayer
participant "MatchTileRepository" as Repository
participant "SimpMessagingTemplate" as StompBroker
participant "Otros Jugadores" as RemoteClients

== 1. Selección y Rotación Concurrente de Loseta (BEAR / JUMP) ==

Player -> View: Selecciona siguiente loseta del mazo de pendientes
alt La loseta seleccionada admite orientación (Oso o Salto de agua)
    Player -> View: Pulsa "Rotate Tile"
    View -> Controller: PATCH /api/v1/matchTiles/{id}/rotate\n[Payload: RotateMatchTileRequest { orientation }]
    activate Controller
    
    Controller -> ServiceLayer: broadcastMatchTileRotation(id, orientation)
    activate ServiceLayer
    
    ServiceLayer -> StompBroker: convertAndSend("/topic/tiles/rotation/" + matchId, updatedTile)
    deactivate ServiceLayer
    
    Controller --> View: 200 OK
    deactivate Controller
    
    StompBroker -> RemoteClients: Frame STOMP en /topic/tiles/rotation/{matchId}
    RemoteClients -> RemoteClients: Actualiza orientación visual de la loseta activa
end

== 2. Colocación de Loseta en el Río ==

Player -> View: Clic en celda válida del tablero (coordenadas X, Y)
View -> Controller: PATCH /api/v1/matchTiles/{id}\n[Payload: PlaceTileRequest { coordinate, orientation }]
activate Controller

Controller -> ServiceLayer: updateCoordinate(id, request)
activate ServiceLayer

ServiceLayer -> ServiceLayer: validateTilePlacement(round, y)
note right
  Verifica que la coordenada vertical Y pertenezca
  a la franja navegable autorizada para la ronda activa.
end note

ServiceLayer -> Repository: save(matchTile)
activate Repository
Repository --> ServiceLayer: MatchTile persistido
deactivate Repository

ServiceLayer -> StompBroker: convertAndSend("/topic/tiles/place/" + matchId, tileDTO)
deactivate ServiceLayer

Controller --> View: 200 OK [MatchTileDTO]
deactivate Controller

== 3. Actualización Reactiva de Tableros ==

StompBroker -> View: Frame STOMP en /topic/tiles/place/{matchId}
StompBroker -> RemoteClients: Frame STOMP en /topic/tiles/place/{matchId}

View -> View: Sincronizar cuadrícula con loseta colocada y actualizar mazo
RemoteClients -> RemoteClients: Sincronizar cuadrícula con loseta colocada y actualizar mazo

@enduml
